Subject: [PATCH 02236/11362] [outer-loop] CarnotAgent competition wrapper
 built + offline-validated (13 levels, 11/11)

ARC Prize 2026 / ARC-AGI-3 submission shape: framework-agnostic CarnotAgentPolicy
(choose_action/is_done) + make_carnot_agent(Agent) factory that adapts onto the real
ARC-AGI-3-Agents base class at submission. v1 = recognize-and-replay our 13 banked
offline-reproduced solutions (Mode-1, no internet -> ideal for the offline eval IF
eval==public-25); step-wise explore fallback for hidden games is TODO v2.
Offline-validated through the competition's step-wise loop (is_done->choose_action->
step) against the real sims: 11/11 games pass, 13 levels, matching claimed. Zero quota.
Kaggle submission itself stays operator-gated.

